\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2bzkvv3-ne8wq.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0a1gboz92241g.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/27jktro2p5rq9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3gzxhq9iq6efl.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/29194twgvgfhb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2s116gu-ckzht.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1td_9romeo9jm.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Who We Are | KODY Works</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Get your bearings on our values, culture, and unique approach.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.png\" type=\"image/png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-transparent\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"header\"><div class=\"corner-light\"></div><div class=\"corner-dark\"></div><div class=\"header-top\"><div class=\"logo-section\"><img alt=\"KODY Works Logo\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"logo-image-header\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.3axgscm0vtymo.jpeg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.3axgscm0vtymo.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.3axgscm0vtymo.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"company-section\"><h1 class=\"company-name\"><span class=\"dark\">KODY</span><span class=\"blue\">Works</span></h1><div class=\"consulting-row\"><div class=\"line-one\"></div><h2>CONSULTING</h2><div class=\"line-one\"></div></div><div class=\"consulting-row\"><div class=\"line-two\"></div><p class=\"tagline\">Delivering Technology Solutions Worldwide</p><div class=\"line-two\"></div></div></div><button class=\"mobile-menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\">☰</button></div><nav class=\"header-nav  \"><ul class=\"nav-list\"><li class=\"nav-item has-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\">Home<span class=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span></button><ul class=\"dropdown-menu \"><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Home 1 (Classic)</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Classic white background layout with services grid</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/index2\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Home 2 (Animated)</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Animated banner with blue gradient design</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/index3\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Home 3 (Green Theme)</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Green animated banner with modern layout</span></a></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item has-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\">Services<span class=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span></button><ul class=\"dropdown-menu \"><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/web-development\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Web Development</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">We specialize in crafting tailored web solutions, leveraging modern technologies and intuitive designs to deliver seamless, user-centric digital experiences.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/generative-ai\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Generative AI</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">AI isn&#x27;t just for tech giants—it&#x27;s for you. We use it to automate, analyze, and enhance your business.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/sap\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">SAP</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Transform enterprise operations with tailored SAP solutions, integrating modules across industries to streamline processes, enhance efficiency, and drive growth.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/mobile-app-development\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Mobile Development</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">An app can make your business stand out. We create ones that engage users, strengthen your brand, and drive results.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/mvp-development\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">MVP</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Launch a functional prototype quickly to gather real-world feedback, refine your product, and attract investors.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/staffing\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Staffing</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Need talent fast? Our IT pros jump in to deliver results without the hiring headache.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/cloud-devops-integrations\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Cloud, DevOps &amp; Custom Integrations</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">The cloud makes your business agile, cost-effective, and connected. We simplify the switch so you can reap the rewards.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/services/salesforce\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Salesforce</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Unlock the full potential of your CRM with our expert Salesforce consulting, seamless implementation, and comprehensive support services.</span></a></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item has-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\">About Chase<span class=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span></button><ul class=\"dropdown-menu \"><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/about/who-we-are\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Who We Are</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Get your bearings on our values, culture, and unique approach.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/about/life-at-american-chase\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Life At KODY Works</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Join a team of passionate innovators reimagining the future of work.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/about/jobs-at-american-chase\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Jobs At KODY Works</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Explore opportunities that inspire, challenge, and unlock your potential.</span></a></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item has-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\">Insights<span class=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span></button><ul class=\"dropdown-menu \"><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/insights/case-studies\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Case Studies</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Explore real-world examples of our solutions in action.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-link\" href=\"/insights/blogs\"><span class=\"dropdown-label\">Blogs</span><span class=\"dropdown-desc\">Indelible insights and perspectives from our thought leaders on the front lines.</span></a></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item \"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/index2\">Showcase</a></li><li class=\"nav-item \"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li></ul></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"who-page\"><section class=\"who-hero\"><div class=\"who-hero-content\"><span class=\"who-hero-eyebrow\">Who We Are</span><h1>Dream Big. Build Bold. Move Forward.</h1><p class=\"who-hero-tagline\">Culture-Driven Growth</p><p class=\"who-hero-sub\">At KODY Works, we are more than a technology company. We are your strategic partner in digital transformation—building solutions that drive real business impact.</p></div></section><section class=\"who-section\"><div class=\"who-section-title\"><span class=\"line\"></span><h2>Our Values</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div><div class=\"who-intro\"><p>Our values are the foundation of everything we do. They guide us as we build long-lasting relationships with our clients, our employees, and the communities we serve.</p></div><div class=\"who-values-grid\"><div class=\"who-value-card\"><div class=\"who-value-icon\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Culture-Driven Growth</h3><p>We foster an environment of learning, earning, and fun. Growth is not just about metrics—it&#x27;s about people.</p></div><div class=\"who-value-card\"><div class=\"who-value-icon\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"></polyline></svg></div><h3>Process-Driven Excellence</h3><p>We focus on clarity, efficiency, and results in every project. Great outcomes start with great processes.</p></div><div class=\"who-value-card\"><div class=\"who-value-icon\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3>Inclusion &amp; Collaboration</h3><p>We believe in equal opportunities and high performance through teamwork. Diverse minds build stronger solutions.</p></div><div class=\"who-value-card\"><div class=\"who-value-icon\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Respect &amp; Empathy</h3><p>Every transaction, every project, every relationship is built on mutual respect and genuine understanding.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"who-section who-section-alt\"><div class=\"who-section-title\"><span class=\"line\"></span><h2>Our Origin</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div><div class=\"who-two-col\"><div class=\"who-two-col-image\"><div class=\"who-image-placeholder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0d4bb8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"></path><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"></path><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"who-two-col-content\"><h2>Started with a dream, built with passion.</h2><p>We love fresh ideas and creative problem-solvers! At KODY Works, young professionals get the space and support to think big, break barriers, and make an impact. We believe that innovation happens when you dare to think differently.</p><p>We provide an environment where bright minds can collaborate, experiment, and grow, turning bold ideas into reality. Here, every voice is heard, and every idea can shape the future.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"who-section\"><div class=\"who-section-title\"><span class=\"line\"></span><h2>What Makes Us Different</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div><div class=\"who-intro\"><p>Code Green. Scale Infinite. Impact Real. These aren&#x27;t just buzzwords—they&#x27;re the principles that define how we work, build, and deliver for our clients.</p></div><div class=\"who-different-grid\"><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H8a4 4 0 00-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>Customer-First Mindset</h4><p>Every customer is unique, and we tailor solutions to their needs, goals, and long-term vision.</p></div></div><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>Sustainable &amp; Scalable Tech</h4><p>We believe in Green Code and sustainable architecture that stands the test of time and scale.</p></div></div><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"21\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>User Experience Matters</h4><p>A great digital experience is the key to success. We put usability at the heart of everything we do.</p></div></div><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 010 2.83 2 2 0 01-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 01-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 009 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 01-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 004.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 010-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 004.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 009 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 014 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0019.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 010 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>AI as Your Growth Partner</h4><p>Artificial Intelligence is not just a tool—it&#x27;s your executive partner in driving real business outcomes.</p></div></div><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>Process-Driven Excellence</h4><p>We focus on clarity, efficiency, and measurable results in every engagement we take on.</p></div></div><div class=\"who-different-card\"><div class=\"who-different-icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><div class=\"who-different-content\"><h4>The Future is Digital</h4><p>We embrace cutting-edge technology because we believe it&#x27;s the only way forward for modern enterprises.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"who-section who-section-alt\"><div class=\"who-section-title\"><span class=\"line\"></span><h2>Our Purpose</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div><div class=\"who-mission-vision\"><div class=\"who-mission-card\"><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>We&#x27;re here to make technology work for people—helping businesses grow, communities thrive, and innovation drive real change. Our goal is to create smart, sustainable solutions that make life easier, more inclusive, and full of possibilities.</p></div><div class=\"who-vision-card\"><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>We see a future where technology brings people together, fuels progress, and makes the world a better place. With innovation, integrity, and heart, we&#x27;re building a smarter, more connected world—one solution at a time.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"who-section\"><div class=\"who-section-title\"><span class=\"line\"></span><h2>Our Leadership Team</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div><div class=\"who-intro\"><p>Since our inception, we&#x27;ve been led by some of the brightest minds in the industry. With a mix of technical and business expertise, our leadership team is poised to take KODY Works to unique frontiers.</p></div><div class=\"who-leadership-grid\"><div class=\"who-leader-card\"><div class=\"who-leader-avatar\">AJ</div><h4>Ayush Jain</h4><p class=\"who-leader-role\">CTO</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"who-leader-social\" aria-label=\"Ayush Jain LinkedIn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"who-leader-card\"><div class=\"who-leader-avatar\">YC</div><h4>Yash Chouhan</h4><p class=\"who-leader-role\">CEO</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"who-leader-social\" aria-label=\"Yash Chouhan LinkedIn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7